    "title": "Activate Product",
    "version": "202309",
    "description": "Activate hidden products that are in the `Seller_deactivated` or `Platform_deactivated` status and display them in the TikTok Shop catalog.\nAfter submitting the activation request, the products will be sent to TikTok Shop for auditing and their status will change to `Pending`. If a product passes the audit, its status will change back to `Activate`. You can use the [Product status change webhook](https://partner.tiktokshop.com/docv2/page/650956aff1fd3102b90b6261) to monitor the audit status."
  },
